<title>FINLAND: Bank of Finland reserves rise FIM 15.7 bln in week.</title>
<headline>Bank of Finland reserves rise FIM 15.7 bln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for January 15 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to January 8  SPFC :</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 52,220	 36,485</p>
<p> Money market intervention    11,558	 12,595</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,906	  1,906</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,265	  2,265</p>
<p> Total assets		     74,311	 59,495</p>
<p>In the previous week to January 8 reserves rose by 88 million markka. --Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
